  The TypeScript implementations of the Xiaomi cloud login, the RC4 /
  HMAC-SHA1 / SHA1 request signing scheme, the device listing flow, and the
  MIoT spec instance lookup are adaptations of the original Python sources in
  custom_components/xiaomi_miot/core/ (xiaomi_cloud.py, utils.py, miot_spec.py)
  of hass-xiaomi-miot, modified for this plugin.

MIoT specification instances are fetched at runtime from the community
mirrors miot-spec.org / spec.miot-spec.com, which publish device specs
following the Xiaomi MIoT-Spec standard
(https://iot.mi.com/new/doc/design/spec/overall). This plugin bundles no
specification data; it downloads what the device urns resolve to.
